# LucidPM currently reads no environment variables at runtime.
#
# Database connection (SQL Server instance name, DB names) is hardcoded in
# LucidPM/state.py (SQL_SERVER, PROD_DB_NAME, TEST_DB_NAME).
#
# All secrets (SMTP credentials, Anthropic API key) are stored encrypted in
# the database (AppSettings / EmailConfig tables). The Fernet encryption key
# itself is auto-generated on first use and persisted in
# AppSettings.LocalEncryptionKey -- there is no key to configure here.
#
# This file exists as a placeholder for future environment-based config.
# See docs/Database.md for details.
